<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-GAUTENG LIONS AND N.TRANSVAAL DRAW SUPER 12 MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-GAUTENG LIONS AND N.TRANSVAAL DRAW SUPER 12 MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gauteng Lions and Northern</p>
<p>Transvaal drew 16-16 (halftime 9-8) in their Super 12 Series</p>
<p>rugby union match at Ellis Park on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Gauteng Lions: Try - Hennie le Roux. Conversion - Johan</p>
<p>Roux. Penalties - Gavin Johnson, Roux (2).</p>
<p>Northern Transvaal: Tries - Jacques Olivier, Graham Bouwer.</p>
<p>Penalties - Graham Bouwer, Casper Steyn.</p>
</text>
